Server init.
>> a := Blob ġdid: 4.
a bytes: ( Lista ġdid ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob ġdid: 4.
b bytes: ( Lista ġdid ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a ġdid.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Ħruġ ikteb: ( a ^ c ), linja-ġdida. } aqbad: { :e Ħruġ ikteb: e, linja-ġdida. }, ibda.
a eħles.
b eħles.
